{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260209005358b258ac7ca3c94269","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have successfully completed the Beauté Clinic website (US-056). Let me provide a summary:\n\n## Summary: US-056 - Beauté Clinic Website ✅\n\n### What Was Created\nA complete, professional single-page website for Beauté Clinic - Dra. Suzan Salvador, specializing in facial harmonization and advanced esthetics in Ribeirão Preto.\n\n### Design Direction: Pearl & Mink Noir\nI chose a completely new aesthetic direction - **Pearl & Mink Noir** - featuring:\n- **Colors**: Soft pearl grays (#E8E4DF), warm mink brown (#8B7E74), rose gold accents (#C9A88C) on cream backgrounds (#FAF8F5)\n- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) + DM Sans (body) for sophisticated French elegance\n- **Unique border-radius patterns**: Pearl-shaped flowing curves (`--radius-pearl-1` through `--radius-pearl-4`) that create soft, luminous animations\n\nThis is the **9th distinct aesthetic palette** in the project, completely different from all previous ones (Rose & Gold, Sage & Pearl, Lavender & Mocha, Emerald & Silk, Rose & Quartz, Amber & Bronze, Plum & Gold, Sapphire & Champagne).\n\n### Features Implemented\n- ✅ Animated hero with 4 floating pearl-shaped backgrounds\n- ✅ Problem/Solution section with narrative cards\n- ✅ 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n- ✅ 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n- ✅ 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n- ✅ Contact form with WhatsApp integration\n- ✅ Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n- ✅ Intersection Observer scroll animations\n- ✅ Accessibility support (prefers-reduced-motion)\n\n### File Created\n- `site-demo/beaute-clinic/index.html` (68 KB)\n\n### Demo URL\n**pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/beaute-clinic**\n\n### Contact Info\n- **Address**: R. Adolfo Serra, 13